# GitHub-facing repository surface
#
# Keep the public/reviewable analysis code small and intentional. Local inputs,
# outputs, notes, cached dependencies, presentations, scratch files, and helper
# state stay on disk but should not be transferred to GitHub.

*

!README.md
!.gitignore
!checkAvailableVariant
!checkCondorQ

!/src/
!/src/**

!/src_AuAu/
!/src_AuAu/**

!/macros/
!/macros/**

!/scripts/
!/scripts/**

!/.github/
!/.github/workflows/
!/.github/workflows/auau-inclusive-weight-contract.yml

!/PhotonJet/
!/PhotonJet/IsolatedPhotonJetAnalysis/
!/PhotonJet/IsolatedPhotonJetAnalysis/**

# Private agent/control-plane state belongs in the private companion repository,
# not this public analysis-code repository.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
agent_context/
agent_context/local/model_routing/
codex_notes/
scripts/os/
scripts/codex*.py
scripts/compat/local/codex*.py

# Generated/build artifacts, including those created inside tracked directories.
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
*.dylib
*.pcm
*.rootmap
*.root
*.d
*_C.d
*_C.so
*_C_ACLiC_dict_rdict.pcm

# Redistribution-safe, hash-bound engineering fixtures and model references.
!PhotonJet/IsolatedPhotonJetAnalysis/tests/fixtures/*.root
!PhotonJet/IsolatedPhotonJetAnalysis/models/artifacts/*.root

# Platform/editor noise.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
